  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Note that LMVT is applicable in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> if <math><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> is continuous in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math> and differentiable in <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>Since <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>f</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mi>x</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"\" separators=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#60;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><msup><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></mtd><mtd><mi>x</mi><mo>&#8805;</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced></math>&nbsp;is non-differentiable at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo></math> hence LMVT cannot be applied to it in <math><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>0,2</mn></mrow></mfenced></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
